<title>NETHERLANDS: HOOGOVENS WINS 45 MLN DFL ITALY ORDER.</title>
<headline>HOOGOVENS WINS 45 MLN DFL ITALY ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV said on Wednesday it had won an order worth more than 45 million guilders to renovate the furnace belonging to Italian steel group Gruppo Lucchini.  </p>
<p>Hoogovens said in a statement the order encompasses project management, parts provision and engineering as well as fitting for the furnace at Piombino in northern Italy.</p>
<p>The production at the furnace would rise to 6,600 tonnes per day from 5,500, Hoogovens added.</p>
